#!/bin/bash
# Labwc/iPad port of Omarchy's backlight picker. Prints the one panel
# backlight the desktop drives: a known iPad panel device, else the only
# readable backlight. Several unknown backlights are ambiguous, so fail.
set -euo pipefail

# The override is for isolated tests, never set by the desktop session.
base=${IPADLINUX_BACKLIGHT_DIR:-/sys/class/backlight}
# J71b panel backlight.
known=(20e200080.backlight)

for name in "${known[@]}"; do
  [[ -d $base/$name ]] && { printf '%s\n' "$name"; exit 0; }
done
device=""
for candidate in "$base"/*; do
  [[ -d $candidate && -r $candidate/max_brightness ]] || continue
  [[ -z $device ]] || exit 1
  device=${candidate##*/}
done
[[ -n $device ]] || exit 1
printf '%s\n' "$device"
